        "original_id": "02aadc66-335e-55bc-b3e8-5b3573e6829e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: When I Was Born for the 7th Time, Brimful of Asha\n- People: Cornershop\n- Companies: Wiiija\n- Topics: album releases, music criticism, chart performance\n\nFacts:\n- When I Was Born for the 7th Time is the third studio album by the British indie rock band Cornershop.\n- Brimful of Asha is a 1997 single by the British alternative rock band Cornershop.\n- When I Was Born for the 7th Time was released on 8 September 1997 by Wiiija.\n- In 1997, Brimful of Asha originally reached number 60 on the UK Singles Chart.\n- When I Was Born for the 7th Time received high acclaim from music critics.\n- When I Was Born for the 7th Time features the international hit single Brimful of Asha.",
